---
const title = "Dulces Godoy — Dulces caseros de Corrientes desde 1954";
const description = "Mamón, zapallo, lima, naranja y aguaí. Frutas del litoral, sin conservantes. Pedís por WhatsApp, enviamos a todo el país.";

// Analítica y verificación de propiedad. Estos IDs no son secretos (quedan
// visibles en el código de cualquier sitio publicado), así que van directo
// acá en vez de por variable de entorno — evita tener que tocar Vercel.
// Vacío = esa integración todavía no se imprime (nunca un ID inventado).
const GSC_VERIFICATION = ''; // verificación ya resuelta con archivo HTML en /public
const GA_MEASUREMENT_ID = 'G-98NK5EN5Y2';
const CLARITY_PROJECT_ID = '';
const META_PIXEL_ID = '';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{title}</title>
  <meta name="description" content={description} />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://dulcesgodoy.com/" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://dulcesgodoy.com/" />
  <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
  <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://dulcesgodoy.com/images/products/mamon-850.jpg" />
  <meta property="og:locale" content="es_AR" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
  <meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://dulcesgodoy.com/images/products/mamon-850.jpg" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/logo-godoy.png" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,500&family=Karla:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root{
      /* Paleta confirmada con Melanie — ver docs/ADN de marca - Dulces Godoy.pdf */
      --cream:#f6eedc;       /* Papel crema */
      --cream-2:#efe2c3;
      --ink:#524641;         /* Marrón Godoy — del logo real */
      --ink-soft:#7a6d63;
      --accent:#a65a2e;      /* Cobre de paila */
      --accent-2:#c98b3d;    /* Almíbar */
      --higo:#6f7a55;        /* Verde monte */
      --line: rgba(44,24,16,.16);
      --paper-line: rgba(44,24,16,.35);
      --shadow: 0 10px 30px -12px rgba(44,24,16,.35);
      color-scheme: light dark;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
      :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
        --cream:#1c130d;
        --cream-2:#241a12;
        --ink:#f3e6d4;
        --ink-soft:#c3ab8c;
        --accent:#d98a5a;
        --accent-2:#e0ac4f;
        --higo:#9aa87c;
        --line: rgba(243,230,212,.16);
        --paper-line: rgba(243,230,212,.3);
        --shadow: 0 10px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
      }
    }
    :root[data-theme="dark"]{
      --cream:#1c130d;
      --cream-2:#241a12;
      --ink:#f3e6d4;
      --ink-soft:#c3ab8c;
      --accent:#d98a5a;
      --accent-2:#e0ac4f;
      --higo:#9aa87c;
      --line: rgba(243,230,212,.16);
      --paper-line: rgba(243,230,212,.3);
      --shadow: 0 10px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box;}
    html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
    body{
      background:var(--cream);
      color:var(--ink);
      font-family:'Karla',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;
      overflow-x:hidden;
    }
    img{max-width:100%;}
    a{color:inherit;}
    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding-inline:24px;}

    /* NAV */
    header.nav{
      position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
      padding:16px 24px;
      background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--cream) 82%, transparent);
      backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .logo{height:34px;width:auto;display:block;}
    .nav-links{display:flex;gap:22px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;}
    .nav-links li a{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink-soft);}
    .nav-links li a:hover{color:var(--ink);}
    @media (max-width:640px){.nav-links{display:none;}}
    .nav-cta{
      font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:999px;
      background:var(--ink);color:var(--cream);text-decoration:none;
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
    }

    /* HERO */
    .hero{
      position:relative;
      min-height:92vh;
      display:flex;align-items:center;
      padding-block:60px 40px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(60% 50% at 85% 20%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 20%, transparent), transparent 70%),
        radial-gradient(50% 40% at 15% 90%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-2) 16%, transparent), transparent 70%);
      overflow:hidden;
    }
    .hero-grid{
      display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;width:100%;
    }
    @media (max-width:860px){
      .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .hero{min-height:auto;padding-block:40px;}
    }
    .hero-eyebrow{
      font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--accent);
      display:inline-block;margin-bottom:10px;
      animation: rise .7s ease-out both;
    }
    .hero h1{
      font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;font-weight:600;
      font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5.6vw,4rem);line-height:1.03;
      margin:0 0 20px;text-wrap:balance;
      animation: rise .8s .05s ease-out both;
    }
    .hero h1 em{
      font-style:italic;font-weight:500;color:var(--accent);
    }
    .hero p.desc{
      font-size:1.08rem;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:46ch;margin:0 0 30px;
      animation: rise .8s .12s ease-out both;
    }
    .hero-actions{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;animation: rise .8s .18s ease-out both;}
    .trust-bar{
      display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px;
      animation: rise .8s .24s ease-out both;
    }
    .trust-bar span{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft);}
    .btn{
      font-family:'Karla';font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;
      padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:1px solid transparent;
      transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
    }
    .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);}
    .btn:active{transform:scale(.97);}
    .btn-primary{background:var(--ink);color:var(--cream);box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
    .btn-ghost{border-color:var(--paper-line);color:var(--ink);}

    .scroll-cue{
      position:absolute;bottom:22px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
      font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;
    }
    .scroll-cue .line{width:1px;height:26px;background:var(--paper-line);animation:pulse-line 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;}

    .jar-wrap{
      position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
      animation: rise .9s .1s ease-out both;
    }
    .hero-photo{
      width:100%;max-width:320px;height:auto;margin:0 auto;display:block;border-radius:18px;
      box-shadow:0 24px 40px -12px rgba(44,24,16,.4);
      object-fit:cover;aspect-ratio:4/5;
    }

    @keyframes rise{from{transform:translateY(14px);}to{transform:translateY(0);}}
    @keyframes pulse-line{0%,100%{opacity:.25;}50%{opacity:.9;}}

    /* FAMILIAS */
    .familias{padding-block:88px;background:var(--cream-2);}
    .section-head{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 44px;text-align:center;}
    .section-head .k{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;color:var(--accent);font-size:1.05rem;}
    .section-head h2{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.5rem);margin:2px 0 10px;}
    .section-head p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0;}

    .size-picker{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:36px;}
    .size-btn{
      border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink-soft);
      font-weight:700;font-size:.82rem;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;
      transition:background .2s ease, color .2s ease, border-color .2s ease;
    }
    .size-btn.active{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--cream);}

    .fam-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px;}
    @media (max-width:760px){.fam-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
    .fam-card{
      background:var(--cream);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;
      padding:22px 22px 26px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);
      transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;
    }
    .fam-card.in-view{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
    .fam-photo-wrap{
      width:100%;height:150px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
      border-radius:12px;margin:0 auto 16px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;transition:background .2s ease;
    }
    .fam-photo-wrap.no-photo .fam-photo{display:none;}
    .fam-photo{height:100%;width:auto;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain;padding:8px;display:block;}
    .fam-card h3{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 6px;}
    .fam-card p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.92rem;margin:0 0 18px;}
    .fam-price{font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:14px;}
    .fam-price .amount{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;}
    .fam-price .note{font-weight:400;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--ink-soft);display:block;margin-top:2px;}
    .pack-hint{
      display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--accent);margin-top:6px;
    }
    .pack-hint--active{color:var(--higo);}

    .temporada-badge{
      display:inline-block;font-family:'Karla',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:.62rem;
      letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);
      border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:999px;padding:2px 8px;
      vertical-align:middle;margin-left:6px;
    }

    .mayorista{margin-top:18px;text-align:center;}
    .mayorista p{font-size:.84rem;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;}
    .mayorista a{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;}
    .add-btn{
      width:100%;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);
      background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;
      cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s ease, color .2s ease, transform .15s ease;
    }
    .add-btn:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--cream);}
    .add-btn:active{transform:scale(.96);}
    .add-btn[hidden]{display:none;}
    .stepper{
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;
      border:1.5px solid var(--accent);border-radius:10px;padding:4px;background:var(--accent);
    }
    .stepper[hidden]{display:none;}
    .step-btn{
      width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;border:none;background:var(--cream);
      color:var(--ink);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;line-height:1;
      transition:transform .15s ease;
    }
    .step-btn:active{transform:scale(.9);}
    .step-qty{color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;}

    /* CART BAR */
    .cart-bar{
      position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:18px;z-index:30;
      display:flex;justify-content:center;pointer-events:none;
    }
    .cart-inner{
      pointer-events:auto;
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;
      background:var(--ink);color:var(--cream);
      padding:12px 14px 12px 20px;border-radius:999px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      transform:translateY(140%);transition:transform .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
      max-width:92vw;
    }
    .cart-inner.show{transform:translateY(0);}
    .cart-count{font-size:.88rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;}
    .cart-total{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;}
    .cart-cta{
      background:#25D366;color:#08260f;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;
      padding:10px 18px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;white-space:nowrap;
      animation: heartbeat 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes heartbeat{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);}50%{transform:scale(1.035);}}

    /* ZONE TOGGLE */
    .zone-demo{padding-block:70px;}
    .zone-card{
      max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--cream-2);border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:20px;padding:30px 28px;text-align:center;
    }
    .zone-card h3{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;margin:0 0 6px;font-size:1.3rem;}
    .zone-card p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.9rem;margin:0 0 20px;}
    .zone-toggle{display:inline-flex;background:var(--cream);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:4px;}
    .zone-toggle button{
      border:none;background:transparent;padding:9px 18px;border-radius:999px;
      font-weight:700;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--ink-soft);cursor:pointer;
    }
    .zone-toggle button.active{background:var(--ink);color:var(--cream);}
    .zone-result{margin-top:18px;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink-soft);min-height:1.4em;}
    .zone-result strong{color:var(--ink);}

    .note-banner{
      max-width:640px;margin:18px auto 0;font-size:.76rem;color:var(--ink-soft);
      border-top:1px dashed var(--line);padding-top:12px;
    }

    footer.site-foot{padding:40px 24px 60px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}

    /* ORIGEN */
    .origen{padding-block:88px;}
    .origen-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr;gap:48px;align-items:center;}
    @media (max-width:820px){.origen-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
    .origen-photo{
      width:100%;max-width:320px;margin:0 auto;display:block;border-radius:16px;
      box-shadow:0 20px 34px -14px rgba(44,24,16,.35);
      object-fit:cover;object-position:top center;aspect-ratio:1/1;
    }
    .origen-caption{
      max-width:320px;margin:10px auto 0;text-align:center;
      font-size:.78rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--ink-soft);
    }
    .origen h2{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.3rem);margin:2px 0 16px;}
    .origen p{color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:52ch;margin:0 0 14px;}

    /* PROCESO */
    .proceso{padding-block:88px;background:var(--cream-2);}
    .proceso-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:28px;margin-top:44px;position:relative;}
    @media (max-width:760px){.proceso-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
    .p-step{text-align:left;}
    .p-n{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--accent);display:block;margin-bottom:8px;}
    .p-step h3{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.15rem;margin:0 0 6px;}
    .p-step p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.9rem;margin:0;}

    /* CIERRE */
    .cierre{padding-block:90px;}
    .cierre-inner{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;}
    .cierre h2{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(2rem,4.4vw,2.6rem);margin:0 0 12px;}
    .cierre p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 0 26px;}

    /* REVEAL (scroll) */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;}
    .reveal.in-view{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}

    /* FOCUS STATES */
    a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible{
      outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:6px;
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      *,*::before,*::after{
        animation-duration:.001ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count:1 !important;
        transition-duration:.001ms !important;
      }
      .reveal, .fam-card{opacity:1 !important;transform:none !important;}
    }
  </style>

  {/* Google Search Console — verificación de propiedad */}
  {GSC_VERIFICATION && (
    <meta name="google-site-verification" content={GSC_VERIFICATION} />
  )}

  {/* Google Analytics 4 */}
  {GA_MEASUREMENT_ID && (
    <>
      <script async src={`https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=${GA_MEASUREMENT_ID}`}></script>
      <script define:vars={{ GA_MEASUREMENT_ID }}>
        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
        function gtag(){ dataLayer.push(arguments); }
        gtag('js', new Date());
        gtag('config', GA_MEASUREMENT_ID);
      </script>
    </>
  )}

  {/* Microsoft Clarity */}
  {CLARITY_PROJECT_ID && (
    <script define:vars={{ CLARITY_PROJECT_ID }}>
      (function(c,l,a,r,i,t,y){
        c[a] = c[a] || function () { (c[a].q = c[a].q || []).push(arguments) };
        t = l.createElement(r); t.async = 1; t.src = "https://www.clarity.ms/tag/" + i;
        y = l.getElementsByTagName(r)[0]; y.parentNode.insertBefore(t, y);
      })(window, document, "clarity", "script", CLARITY_PROJECT_ID);
    </script>
  )}

  {/* Meta Pixel */}
  {META_PIXEL_ID && (
    <>
      <script define:vars={{ META_PIXEL_ID }}>
        !function(f,b,e,v,n,t,s){
          if(f.fbq)return; n=f.fbq=function(){n.callMethod?n.callMethod.apply(n,arguments):n.queue.push(arguments)};
          if(!f._fbq)f._fbq=n; n.push=n; n.loaded=!0; n.version='2.0'; n.queue=[];
          t=b.createElement(e); t.async=!0; t.src=v;
          s=b.getElementsByTagName(e)[0]; s.parentNode.insertBefore(t,s);
        }(window, document,'script','https://connect.facebook.net/en_US/fbevents.js');
        fbq('init', META_PIXEL_ID);
        fbq('track', 'PageView');
      </script>
      <noscript>
        <img height="1" width="1" style="display:none" src={`https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=${META_PIXEL_ID}&ev=PageView&noscript=1`} />
      </noscript>
    </>
  )}
</head>
<body>

<header class="nav">
  <img class="logo" src="/images/logo-godoy.png" alt="Godoy — Dulces Caseros, desde 1954">
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#familias">Selección</a></li>
    <li><a href="#origen">Origen</a></li>
    <li><a href="#zona">Envíos</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a class="nav-cta" href="#familias">Ver dulces →</a>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="hero-eyebrow">&ldquo;Endulzando momentos&rdquo;</span>
      <h1>El mismo dulce<br>de casa, desde <em>1954</em></h1>
      <p class="desc">Mamón, zapallo, lima, naranja y aguaí, cocidos en Corrientes desde 1954. Frutas del litoral, sin conservantes. Elegís los sabores y coordinamos la entrega por WhatsApp.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#familias">Elegir sabores y pedir</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" id="quickWhatsapp" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ya sé qué quiero ↗</a>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-bar">
        <span>🕰️ Desde 1954</span>
        <span>🌿 Sin conservantes</span>
        <span>📦 Envíos a todo el país</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="jar-wrap">
      <img src="/images/hero-mostrador.jpg" alt="Las pailas de cobre y el mostrador de la fábrica Dulces Godoy" class="hero-photo">
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-cue"><span>scroll</span><span class="line"></span></div>
</section>

<section class="origen" id="origen">
  <div class="container origen-grid">
    <div class="origen-visual reveal">
      <img src="/images/miguel-furgon.jpg" alt="Miguel Ángel Godoy junto a la camioneta de reparto de Dulces Caseros Godoy, años 90" class="origen-photo">
      <p class="origen-caption">Miguel Ángel Godoy, en los 90 — salía él mismo a buscar la fruta.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="hero-eyebrow">de dónde viene</span>
      <h2>Cuatro generaciones de la misma familia</h2>
      <p>Empezó en 1954: Clelia Gadea de Godoy cocinaba mamón en almíbar en su casa para ayudar a la economía familiar. Vendía de a poco a vecinos, después a hoteles y restaurantes — hasta llegar a las góndolas de Corrientes.</p>
      <p>En 1993 su hijo Miguel Ángel Godoy recompró la fábrica junto a Beatriz, su esposa, y la relanzó como &ldquo;Dulces Caseros Godoy&rdquo;. En 2016 la heredó Mirta Clarisa Godoy, que sostuvo la misma calidad y el mismo método.</p>
      <p>Hoy la cuarta generación —Melanie Scherf y Matías Woelflin— sigue al frente. Seguimos cocinando mamón, zapallo, lima, naranja y aguaí de la misma manera: en olla, tanda por tanda, sin conservantes.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="proceso" id="proceso">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="k">cómo se hace</span>
      <h2>Del fruto al frasco, sin atajos</h2>
      <p>Tres pasos, siempre los mismos.</p>
